I hit this with five USB drives in a sizebalanced group.


### Have you had any luck using git-annex before? (Sometimes we get tired of reading bug reports all day and a lil' positive end note does wonders)

Yes, it manages a few TB across six drives here. I like that I can see all my
files on my computer without having all the external drives attached, or having
to remember which drive a file is on. I also like that it takes care of my
backups at the same time, with the numcopies setting. Lately I've been testing
the new balanced preferred content on my USB drives, which is how I found this.


